{"campaign": "repeat", "block": "mtp3-rep", "config": {"max_context": 32768, "kv_capacity": 32768, "kv_dtype": "i4", "prefill_chunk": 64, "cuda_graph": false, "prefix_reuse": false, "greedy": true, "max_concurrency": 1, "default_max_tokens": 4096, "spec": "mtp", "draft_tokens": 3}, "fixture": "scenario_story_zh_dialogue", "category": null, "seed": 111, "max_new": 2048, "thinking": false, "greedy": true, "wall_seconds": 26.491736572002992, "vram_peak_mib": 14246, "vram_after_load_mib": 14242, "load_seconds": 11.894098156, "server_instance_id": "serve-1-1789746055599198", "content_sha256": "6a706ac11090e2177f89040660dcb97dd28b82fa6499eb12d1b20dff37e60a87", "content_chars": 2815, "reasoning_chars": 0, "content_head": "暴雨如注，黑沉沉的天幕仿佛被一只巨手揉皱，雨水不再是落下的，而是横着扫过青石长街。大梁王朝的永宁县城，此刻正浸泡在一片浑浊的泥水中。这是百年未遇的洪峰，上游的群山在咆哮，而眼前这道守护了县城三百年的“安澜堤”，正发出令人牙酸的断裂声。\n\n县衙正堂内，烛火在穿堂风中剧烈摇曳，将四个人的影子拉得忽长忽短，如同鬼魅。\n\n县令赵公年过五旬，官袍早已湿透，贴在身上，显得身形佝偻。他死死盯着面前那张铺在案几上", "content_tail": "自己年轻时，也曾像沈砚这样，相信档案里的每一个字都是真理。但岁月告诉他，真理是活的，它会随着环境改变。\n\n“老夫信你。”顾岑缓缓说道，“但有一个条件。若拆子堤后，水流失控，反噬永宁，老夫愿以死谢罪。”\n\n赵公看着顾岑，又看着沈砚，最后看向阿洛。“阿洛，你意下如何？”\n\n阿洛眯起眼睛，看着沈砚：“沈河工，若拆子堤，新集必淹。我阿洛的货，至少损失一半。但我若支持你，你沈砚欠我一个人情。日后若我阿洛有难", "finish_reason_http": "length", "metrics": {"prompt_tokens": 135, "computed_prefill_tokens": 135, "completion_tokens": 2048, "finish_reason": "output_limit", "prefix_cache_hit_tokens": 0, "prepare_seconds": 0.001517515, "vision_seconds": 0.0, "prefill_seconds": 0.24165065300000002, "decode_seconds": 26.242604298999943, "total_seconds": 26.490789842999998, "ttft_seconds": 0.243223733, "prefill_tok_s": 558.6577082413263, "server_ttft_ms": 243.168168, "decode_tok_s": 78.00292900343003, "spec_backend": "mtp", "spec_draft_window": 3, "spec_rounds": 973, "spec_drafted": 2917, "spec_accepted": 1073, "spec_acceptance": 0.36784367500857046, "spec_tokens_per_round": 2.1027749229188077, "spec_fallback_steps": 1, "accepted_per_position": [611, 319, 143]}, "ts": 1789746123.4469264, "content_file": "/out/repeat/content/mtp3-rep__scenario_story_zh_dialogue__111.txt"}
